  "_comment": "Drives scripts/scaffold.py. 'when' is AND over flags; 'when_any' is OR; 'when_not' skips when ANY listed flag is set. Flags: the purpose profiles purpose_code, purpose_research, purpose_strategy, purpose_docs (one or more; none means purpose_code), ui, db, db_engineer, db_seeder, ai, audit, tdd, ddd, light, unit, e2e, tests, deploy_ask, long, solo_review, merge_gate, terse, rtk, hooks_strict, pr_cli, target_cursor, target_codex, and exactly one of windows|posix. 'checker' is DERIVED (set whenever a non-code purpose is) and never written in vars.json. target_cursor/target_codex gate no entry here - they are recorded so /harness-update knows what to re-port. claude/agents/dev-agent.md and root/module-CLAUDE.md are intentionally absent - per-domain templates instantiated once per dev agent and once per vars.json \"modules\" entry, not files to copy.",
